e: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ol-adpad\" style=\"padding: 20px 3.5% 0 3.5%;\"><p class=\"b\"\r\nstyle=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; font-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #008dc8; font-weight:700;\"\r\n>\r\nA MESSAGE FROM PEPSICO\r\n</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 3.5%; line-height: 1.5;\"><span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #222222;  font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;\">How to shift leadership in the era of AI</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48064844.430671/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3Nwb25zb3JlZC9ob3ctcGVvcGxlLWZpcnN0LWxlYWRlcnNoaXAtZnVlbHMtYWk_YXhpb3NfYWRsaW5rPTEmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB82716055\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tpc.googlesyndication.com/pageadimg/imgad?id=CICAgJC9nvKQ4QEQARgBKAEyCGsIUywY-9BM\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p>As technology and AI use accelerates, leadership strategy must be transformed.</p>\r\n<p><strong>An expert take:</strong> “A leader’s role is less about having all the answers and more about creating clarity and removing friction,” says Athina Kanioura, CEO of PepsiCo Latin America Foods.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48064844.430671/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3Nwb25zb3JlZC9ob3ctcGVvcGxlLWZpcnN0LWxlYWRlcnNoaXAtZnVlbHMtYWk_YXhpb3NfYWRsaW5rPTEmdXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC82716055\" target=\"_blank\">Explore PepsiCo’s strategy.</a></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🐕 Goodness to go! </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td> <img src=\"https://images.axios.com/6vcJKYPai3ANx3Z5HSdTEJn7Tzc=/0x0:1920x1080/1920x1080/2025/12/10/1765384300083.jpeg\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" id=\"item03\" alt=\"Illustration of a heart textured with orange and white pet fur. \"> </td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.3\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#848484\"> <p>Illustration: Maura Kearns/Axios</p> </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><p><strong>A wonderful moment </strong>between strangers,<strong> </strong>shared by reader Gary Guttman of Chicago:</p><ul><li><strong>\"On my walk</strong> around the lake, a dog trotted up clearly hoping to be petted, so I stopped, gave him a good scratch, and spent a few minutes chatting with his owner. It was a tiny moment, but we all walked away happier.\"</li></ul><p><em>Tell us about the random acts of kindness you witness out in the world at <a href=\"mailto:finishline@axios.com\" target=\"_blank\">finishline@axios.com</a> — and we'll keep sharing them!</em></p></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48064844.430671/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNjBlMmY1ZDktZjExYy00Y2UwLWI0MGUtYjI2ZDE5OWY2NGVjLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCe3237254\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48064844.430671/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_dGV4dD0lRjAlOUYlOTAlOTUlMjBHb29kbmVzcyUyMHRvJTIwZ28lMjEmaGFzaHRhZ3M9YXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnVybD1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNjBlMmY1ZDktZjExYy00Y2UwLWI0MGUtYjI2ZDE5OWY2NGVjLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0R0d3NvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC94ac8a7d\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-x-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Tweet this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48064844.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-linkedin-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Post to LinkedIn\"></a>  <a href=\"mailto:?subject=From Axios: 🐕 Goodness to go!&body=teruyuki%40hh.iij4u.or.jp%20has%20shared%20an%20Axios%20story%20with%20you%3A%0A%0A🐕 Goodness to go!%0Ahttp